<description>&lt;p&gt;Fitgharan forces are securing the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor while Laftagareen forces have captured Buurhakaba after heavy fighting in the Bay region and opposition fighters seized a third town in just over a week. The Somali government is screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case and is hosting regional talks in Egypt with Eritrea, Sudan and its own officials to coordinate security amid rising Ethiopia-Eritrea tensions. Defence ties with Pakistan are deepening as Somalia seeks JF-17 fighter jets and has arranged the release of four Pakistani sailors freed from pirates. A presidential election is scheduled for May 2027. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQTUR5bjEydHlCUDlDTkNweFFHc2Uyb1UzazBFOEwtOHo1SXNFWmxQNm84djA4NnFCbU9jTXQzR2FGMTJlcndWazVMSFVBQ1BpeHd5RkpoZnMwME0xaVR6ZGdIOVZlOGJ1VnZSLTFTUElaYzMyN19NM255ZDNmUHA5ZTFaTk1JTk02dk0xVS1UcXYwVzJsUnV1T2RqVUFwVU10d2VRRDFnWE5PS0lySi1jSG03QlJJZ1pLUXRJemUwa0ZhYkFNc0RfSEJR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPMFR1MlFYWmhVTGp4OWhNOVRnVnhKRGRrVUxLZ1VpZ0ZDemYzT0hCTFJDWGhreE1oUEJxblBxYk1kdk5uZ2FMU1BSN3ptTGlGLTdlWkpDZ29VZVpYWmlVU01yUDZ1RVlxOFl0Z3RtRUVvYVlwUVJfUDR3VjBDZ3hqbWpjOTN4SVVkSmhrWW50Tld0dWU5YVV6RVBqNTZ2UE1CTXdkLU4wT1cxeE5Sd21V?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somalia Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOcXdJeDgzMFBMd05vTXFZWEpIZk1jcEZucTRHbTNfemZrdTBvSkFmMG1leGN0Y3FsTE1NWFF4ZHZpZ2FzTHpUaDh4ajBBN2RWYXlyYzM5RDVUODJjUHlwNFNsdnMtTnVHTDNRM0xYX3ExY0k1YkNfY0pZVHktYmt5eU5OVF82eW0xWmtqT2ZH